---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ProjectShots from '../../components/ProjectShots.astro';
import Section from '../../components/Section.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Team Brain — Michal Malček"
  description="Team Brain: an AI knowledge hub for msg life Slovakia."
  back={{ href: `${base}production/`, label: 'Production' }}
>
  <header class="pt-10 pb-8 border-b border-line">
    <h1 class="text-[clamp(35px,4.8vw,52px)] font-semibold tracking-tight m-0 mb-3">Team Brain</h1>
    <p class="lede m-0">AI knowledge hub, msg life Slovakia. Delivered and handed over Jun 2026.</p>
  </header>

  <Section id="intro" title="Intro" note="features">
    <ul class="m-0 pl-5 flex flex-col gap-2 text-[17.5px] text-fg-dim leading-snug list-disc">
      <li>Built and handed over a production agentic AI system, Team Brain (brain.msgweb.io, still in production), on the Anthropic SDK for autonomous web analytics, SEO optimization and content production.</li>
      <li>Ran the Claude API for a 15-person SEO and content team on one Hetzner 8 GB VPS. Every figure below is from a database-generated usage report.</li>
      <li>Role formalised as AI Engineer in Jan 2026; 4 AI and 5 SEO workshops for the entire Slovak branch.</li>
      <li>Consolidated topic clusters: 2 on msg-life.sk/clanky, 4 on msgprogramator.sk, 4 on msgtester.sk (AI/ML, Cloud, Java, Programming, Testing, IT Career), plus the content of 8 IT profession pages.</li>
      <li>With Claude.ai, Gemini, Microsoft Copilot and NotebookLM, created 2 clustered glossary frameworks (AI terms, HR terms), 8 custom skills (SEO Brief, Analyst, Writer and others), SEO strategies for 2025 and 2026, a Content DNA, a Brand Voice Guide, about 80 optimized articles and 40 SEO briefs for copywriters, all published on the msg sites.</li>
      <li>Doubled site traffic in a year despite slow release cycles on an agency-managed WordPress site.</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <ProjectShots slug="team-brain" alt="Team Brain" part="hero" />

  <Section id="links" title="Download and links" note="links">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-[17px]">
      <a href="https://brain.msgweb.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Team Brain (production)</a>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section id="results" title="Results" note="measured">
    <ul class="m-0 pl-5 flex flex-col gap-2 text-[17.5px] text-fg-dim leading-snug list-disc">
      <li>Recorded 1,352 tool calls at 93.9% success across 25 tools, each with its own measured rate, including the weak ones.</li>
      <li>Spent about $30 a month on the API (billed; closer to $22). Haiku routes tools and Sonnet writes the synthesis, a cost split that lives in the code.</li>
      <li>Served 15 users, all 15 active, across 446 conversations, 3,558 messages, 549 agent runs and 1,480 reports.</li>
      <li>Processed 50.2M input, 2.25M output and 4.95M cached tokens over those 549 runs.</li>
      <li>Produced 1,121 articles, 514 memories and 1,454 embeddings.</li>
      <li>Connected four live sources — Search Console, GA4, Ahrefs and CrUX — through a seven-layer prompt system with agents, personas and a semantic layer.</li>
      <li>Shipped on the official Anthropic SDK from the first commit, with full documentation and a clean handover to non-engineers.</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <ProjectShots slug="team-brain" alt="Team Brain" part="gallery" />
</Base>
